  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Rahul Rajendra Malbhare vs State Of Maharashtra on 9 May, 2024 957 aba 1223 of In The High Court Of Judicature At Bombay Criminal Appellate Jurisdiction Anticipatory Bail Application No.1223 Of 2024 Api Nagnath G. Patil, Supa Police Station present. Coram: N.J.Jamadar, J. Date : 9 May 2024",
    "facts": "2. This is an application for pre-arrest bail in connection with CR No.110 of 2024 registered with Supa Police Station, Baramati, Pune, for the offences punishable under Sections 328, 188, 272 of Indian Penal Code, 1860 (\"the Penal Code\") and Sections 26(2)(i), 3(1)(zz)(iv), 59, 27(2)(iv), 27(3)(d), 27(3)(e) of the Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006. Contraband articles which were recovered from the co-accused Prashant Gandhi were to be allegedly delivered to the applicant.",
    "arguments": ""
  },
